{"slug":"alma-de-hierro","updated":"2026-10-09","item":{"title":"Alma de Hierro","slug":"alma-de-hierro","kind":"tv","language":"Spanish","genre":"Drama","released":"2008-02-25","runtime":25,"review":"Alma de Hierro is a 2008–2009 Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa. It is a remake of the Argentinian soap opera Son de Fierro, with the character's names rewritten and adapted to the Mexican audience. The main actors were Blanca Guerra, Alejandro Camacho, Christian Vega, Flavio Medina, Lisardo and Alejandra Barros, with Jorge Poza, Zuria Vega, Adamari López, Angelique Boyer, Eddy Vilard, Martha Julia and Luz María Aguilar playing supporting roles. The show earned 8 awards at the \"TV y Novelas\" award celebration, becoming the highest-awarded production of the 2009 season.","cast":["Adrián Uribe","Angelique Boyer","Alejandro Camacho","Blanca Guerra","Jorge Poza","Martha Julia"],"castPics":[{"name":"Adrián Uribe","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iqJaO3CpdxWTK6qv32UcpvFrqd6.jpg","character":"Ezequiel Hierro Jiménez"},{"name":"Angelique Boyer","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/c73CU85L1sHganTpVUHnjw3gbba.jpg","character":"Sandra 'Sandy' Hierro Jiménez"},{"name":"Alejandro Camacho","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mpKV45d1KCOF9NFyr7ZHL38schz.jpg","character":"José Antonio Hierro Ramírez"},{"name":"Blanca Guerra","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/h9yxcLrvJmlEBo7OogF3gMB85mX.jpg","character":"Elena Jiménez de Hierro"},{"name":"Jorge Poza","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vSk1tUuzFlZXT0bwaY7rpCVsYFe.jpg","character":"Sebastián Hierro Jiménez"},{"name":"Martha Julia","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1fE3SSQeomWp13SOiSM0I2whS10.jpg","character":"Patricia 'Paty' Jiménez de la Corcuera"}],"providers":["Atresplayer"],"rentBuy":[],"platform":"Atresplayer","rating":7.8,"votes":40,"similar":[{"title":"Amores Perros","slug":"amores-perros","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1lX74fPZsBoOyyE5fWL5xT7k9sV.jpg,https://image.tmdb.org/